// Field Pro (pro.radiation-lab.com) on Cloudflare Workers — static assets only, no Worker script. (T8, 2026-10-28)
//
// ★★ Why not Vercel any more: Vercel Hobby's fair-use policy forbids commercial use and names Google AdSense, and ads
//   are planned on the guide pages (decision D13). The umbrella and RadCalc moved for the same reason on 2026-10-06;
//   this is the same pattern (their wrangler.jsonc).
// ★ The route acts only while the `pro` DNS record is proxied (orange cloud). While it is DNS-only, Vercel keeps
//   serving and this Worker answers only at its workers.dev address — that is how it is checked before the switch,
//   and turning the record back to DNS-only is the rollback.
// ★ `dist/` is `npm run build`; .github/workflows/deploy.yml copies `cf/_headers` into it before `wrangler deploy`.
// ★ Pages are directories (`/guide/` — the canonical, the sitemap and every link use the slash). `auto-trailing-slash`
//   sends `/guide` to `/guide/` with a 307; Vercel answered both forms with 200.
{
  "name": "radiation-lab-pro",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "workers_dev": true,
  "preview_urls": false,
  "routes": [
    { "pattern": "pro.radiation-lab.com/*", "zone_name": "radiation-lab.com" }
  ],
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash"
  }
}
